<title>FRANCE: New Axa group aims for 15 pct ROE soon after 2000.</title>
<headline>New Axa group aims for 15 pct ROE soon after 2000.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurance group Axa said that the new group to be created by its merger with rival UAP would aim to achieve a return on equity of 15 percent as soon as possible after the year 2000.</p>
<p>&quot;Before the merger, we (Axa) were saying that we hoped to attain 15 percent return on equity in the year 2000. Now we are saying as soon as possible (for the new merged group) after this date but we are not saying when yet,&quot; said a spokeswoman.</p>
<p>&quot;The goal is to make the new group as profitable as possible,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
